Package: aurora-xart
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: python3, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: fprintd
Description: Secure Enclave and xART state tool for Apple silicon Macs (Aurora)
 aurora-xart inspects and manages the Linux side of the Secure Enclave and
 its xART storage on Apple silicon Macs: it reports the state of the Touch ID
 keybag and session records, and "aurora-xart reset-touchid" starts Touch ID
 over when its keybag is stuck. With fprintd installed it opens the Touch ID
 sensor before judging a stored keybag.
